    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d336">

                <pb facs="0459" n="449" sameAs="frus:frus1942China/pg449"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/7459</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Treasury</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgenthau</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-01-29">January 29,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Cordell</hi>: The President returned to me
                    the letter which I received from T. V. Soong, dated January 21, 1942,<anchor
                        n="65" xml:id="d336-f1"/> and attached <pb facs="0460" n="450"
                        xml:id="pg450"/> thereto a memorandum, a photostat of which you will find
                    enclosed herewith. Upon receipt of this memorandum from the President, I wrote a
                    letter to Dr. Soong, a copy of which I am also enclosing.</p>
                <p>There is also enclosed a photostat of a letter which I received January 27, 1942,
                    from Sir Frederick Phillips<anchor n="66" xml:id="d336-f2"/> stating the British
                    position on the Chinese request.</p>
                <p>I believe that with these enclosures you now have a complete file of my
                    correspondence on the China loan proposal.</p>
                <p>Sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Morgenthau, Jr.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d336-a1.xml" xpointer="d336-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d336-a2.xml" xpointer="d336-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
